## The box of rich text (record 0112): a stretch of a text in which the look is set by hand, as in a word processor

# The name of such a stretch: at its head in the text, and in the Insert menu, where it puts one in.
byhand-name = Formatierter Text
# The button at the head of such a stretch, shown as three dots, which opens the menu of the stretch.
byhand-menu = Mehr
# In that menu: selects everything the stretch holds.
byhand-select = Auswählen
# In that menu: the stretch becomes ordinary text again; what it holds stays where it is.
byhand-to-text = Zu gewöhnlichem Text machen
# In that menu: takes the stretch away with everything in it.
byhand-delete = Löschen

## The tools at the head of rich text, which set the look by hand (record 0113). They show while the cursor is in it. The names of bold, of the alignments and of the measures of a paragraph are those the rest of the application has.

# The first tool, a list: whether the paragraphs selected are ordinary text or a heading. A heading here is a paragraph that looks like a heading of the document; it is no part of the outline and has no number (record 0115).
byhand-level = Text oder Überschrift
# The choices of that list. "Heading" looks as the headings one level under the element the text belongs to; "Subheading" as those a level further down.
byhand-text = Text
byhand-heading = Überschrift
byhand-subheading = Zwischenüberschrift
# In the list of fonts, the list of sizes and the menu of colours: what takes the font, the size or the colour away, so that the words are as the document sets them.
byhand-as-document = Wie das Dokument
# Shown in the place of a font, a size or a colour where the words selected have several.
byhand-several = Mehrere
# In the list of fonts: the group of those already used in this text.
byhand-fonts-here = In diesem Text
# The button that opens the menu of colours for the words selected.
byhand-colour = Farbe
# The colours of that menu, by their plain names.
byhand-colour-black = Schwarz
byhand-colour-grey = Grau
byhand-colour-red = Rot
byhand-colour-orange = Orange
byhand-colour-green = Grün
byhand-colour-blue = Blau
byhand-colour-purple = Lila
byhand-colour-brown = Braun
# The last entry of the menu of colours: opens the system's own window for choosing any colour.
byhand-colour-other = Andere Farbe…
# The button that opens a small panel with the line spacing, the space before and after, and the indents of the paragraphs selected.
byhand-paragraph = Absatz
# In that panel, under each field: what an empty field means.
byhand-paragraph-empty = Leer bedeutet: wie im Dokument.
# The button at the end of the row of tools, where the head is too narrow for all of them: opens a menu with those that do not fit.
byhand-more-tools = Weitere Werkzeuge
# The button that takes away everything set by hand of what is selected: fonts, sizes, colours, and how the paragraphs stand. Bold and italic stay.
byhand-clear = Formatierung entfernen
# In the menu of the three dots: opens the Look, where the font and the size of the whole document are set, with its notes and headings.
byhand-whole = Das Aussehen des ganzen Dokuments…
# The question asked before rich text that has something set by hand is made ordinary text.
byhand-to-text-title = Zu gewöhnlichem Text machen?
byhand-to-text-warning = Was darin von Hand eingestellt ist, wird entfernt: Schriften, Größen und Farben, Überschriften und wie die Absätze stehen. Die Wörter bleiben.
